---
description: Aurora OpenCode build and rebuild workflow
globs: ["**/*.d"]
alwaysApply: true
---

See `AGENTS.md` at the repository root for the full instructions.

Editing `.d` sources does **not** change the running
`aurora-opencode-pro.exe`. After any change: `dub build` (release), confirm the
binary is newer than the sources, relaunch the app, then report what you
verified. A stale binary produces errors such as `undefined identifier` for code
that is actually present in the source.
